# MCSM Vita trophy definitions -> TROPHY.TRP (see make_trophy_pack.py)
#
# All 51 names/descriptions/grades are the OFFICIAL retail list, taken from a saved
# PSNProfiles page. Grade totals check out: 1 platinum, 8 gold, 19 silver, 23 bronze.
#
# ID MAPPING IS EVIDENCED, NOT ASSUMED: trophy id = (PSNProfiles number - 1), so
# PSN #1 (the platinum) is id 000. That was cross-checked against a completely
# independent grouping derived from WHICH .ttarch2 archive fires each
# AchievementManager_Unlock -- every episode boundary agrees:
#     Ep1 1..7  Ep2 8..13  Ep3 14..19  Ep4 21..26
#     Ep5 27..32 Ep6 33..38 Ep7 39..44  Ep8 45..50
# The ids that archive scan did not see (7,13,20,26,32,44) are the Chapter 6
# finales plus the Reuben special -- fired from end-of-episode scripts, not the
# chapter scenes, which is exactly why they were absent.
npcommid = MCSM00002_00
title    = Minecraft: Story Mode
detail   = A Telltale Games Series
